  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Moderniz Contralora Gral de la Rep y Desconc del Sistema Nacional de Control</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Moderniz of Controller Gral Office  Deconcent of National Control System</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecer las entidades que integran el Sistema Nacional de Control (SNC), a partir de la reforma y actualizacin de los enfoques y mtodos de control, la ampliacin de su cobertura y la consolidacin del proceso de desconcentracin, para elevar la efectividad del control de los recursos pblicos, contribuyendo de este modo al mejoramiento de la gobernabilidad democrtica del pas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program&apos;s general objective is to support the principles of due process and administrative probity, provide greater protection of the State&apos;s assets, and promote public-sector efficiency by modernizing the Office of the Comptroller General of the Republic (CGR) and strengthening and decentralizing the National Control System (NCS). The project&apos;s specific objectives are to make control over public funds more effective, reform control approaches and methods, strengthen and decentralize the NCS, encourage a culture of values and promote better coordination among government agencies, society at large and the private sector.</narrative>
  </description>
